# Most Common Pattern

```python
df.groupby("category_column")["numeric_column"].mean()
```

Read As:

```text
Group By Category
↓
Take Numeric Column
↓
Find Average
```

---

# Most Important Interview Pattern

```python
df.groupby("category_column").agg({
    "numeric_column":
    [
        "mean",
        "max",
        "min"
    ]
})
```

Read As:

```text
Group By Category
↓
Take Numeric Column
↓
Find

Average
Highest
Lowest
```

